  "goodToKnow": "Schier has two uses. As an adverb, it means almost or practically: schier unmöglich, schier endlos, eine schier unglaubliche Geschichte. As an adjective, it means sheer or pure, like English sheer: aus schierer Verzweiflung (out of sheer desperation), die schiere Menge. It's slightly literary but common in journalism. Related to English sheer."
